<title>SINGAPORE: Wepco plunges into red in 1996.</title>
<headline>Wepco plunges into red in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit/loss		     (1.73) vs    0.35</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  (10.64) vs    2.14</p>
<p>    Turnover				20.01  vs   24.28</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.12  vs    0.82</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.66  vs    1.02</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     2.10  vs    2.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit/loss		 (1.65) vs    0.03</p>
<p>    Tax					0.02  vs    0.35</p>
<p>    Minorities			    (0.10) vs   (0.04)</p>
<p>Note - Wepco Ltd said the downturn in the electronics industry had adversely affected its results. Its electro-plating and plastic injection divisions recorded sharp declines in margins. -- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
